WEBVTT

00:00:02.330 --> 00:00:05.830
The dragons of this star are weeping.

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:07.970
No!

00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:09.840
So this is the Devil's power...

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:12.570
<i>Captured by Machiavelli,</i>

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:15.660
<i>tortured, wounded in heart and soul,</i>

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:18.710
<i>Jeanne was saved by Nobunaga.</i>

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:24.080
<i>Yet just then,
 severe turbulence in the ley lines</i>

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:29.050
<i>reduced her birthplace,
 Donremy, to ash before her very eyes.</i>

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:33.600
<i>To Jeanne is seemed that, ironically,</i>

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:35.080
<i>fate itself had said her savior,</i>

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:37.610
<i>Nobunaga, was the Destroyer-King.</i>

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:42.240
Am I... the Destroyer-King?

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:10.730
Is it because Nobunaga came here?

00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:13.670
Is it true that Nobunaga is...

00:01:15.210 --> 00:01:17.140
That can't be true.

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:18.860
It can't.

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:21.910
But you saw with your own eyes.

00:01:21.910 --> 00:01:22.630
The village...

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:24.010
Everyone...

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:25.590
What are you saying?

00:01:32.010 --> 00:01:34.530
With the appearance of
 the Eastern Regalia wielder,

00:01:35.050 --> 00:01:37.520
and the girl who sees visions,

00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:40.850
my star enters a new era.

00:01:44.430 --> 00:01:47.850
When the twelve Chosen assemble,

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:51.350
the ultimate Regalia,
 the Holy Grail, will appear.

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:55.420
In the near future, its sacred wielder

00:01:55.420 --> 00:01:57.030
will also come to this Round Table.

00:02:04.450 --> 00:02:06.320
Will the Holy Grail come first,

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:08.770
or will destruction come upon us?

00:03:55.310 --> 00:03:59.240
Bring Nobunaga and the
 girl who sees visions here.

00:04:01.180 --> 00:04:03.360
What we need are Regalia.

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:05.630
I will acquire them without fail.

00:04:05.630 --> 00:04:07.710
Two rats have fled...

00:04:07.710 --> 00:04:08.510
Cesare.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:11.220
Machiavelli.

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:14.350
A forest lies beyond the cave.

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:18.220
They must be awaiting
 rescue from their allies there.

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:29.100
If I get rid of the girl 
and obtain the Regalia...

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:34.130
Though I am currently invisible 
in King Arthur's eyes,

00:04:34.690 --> 00:04:36.690
I am sure His Majesty would acknowledge me.

00:04:37.430 --> 00:04:38.510
If that happens...

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:41.890
I will gain a seat at the Round Table.

00:04:42.430 --> 00:04:43.400
Machiavelli.

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:47.230
If necessary, you may kill both of them.

00:04:47.860 --> 00:04:50.020
But what of King Arthur's command?

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:55.390
His Majesty desires the Regalia 
and those worthy of wielding them.

00:04:56.830 --> 00:04:57.860
I see.

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:01.040
Foolish woman...

00:05:03.350 --> 00:05:05.270
The ley line turbulence is severe.

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:06.800
If we continue to tarry here,

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:08.630
we'll collide with a cliff.

00:05:09.640 --> 00:05:10.640
This is bad.

00:05:10.640 --> 00:05:13.080
If we emerge, we'll be a sitting duck.

00:05:13.560 --> 00:05:15.640
Rather than going to rescue my betrothed,

00:05:15.640 --> 00:05:17.610
we'd be in peril, ourselves.

00:05:17.610 --> 00:05:21.080
In the worst case, we must be 
willing to leave Azuchi behind.

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:23.660
What about Nobu-sama and Ranmaru?!

00:05:23.660 --> 00:05:27.640
I will go out with a wing-horse
 to find and rescue them.

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:30.330
But that'd make you the target.

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:31.350
Sir Mitsuhide.

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:34.300
Caesar-dono.

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:37.600
I will hold the enemy at bay in my Quo Vadis.

00:05:37.950 --> 00:05:41.090
Why not go rescue them in the meantime?

00:05:41.090 --> 00:05:42.300
But...

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:44.840
Do you still doubt me?

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:47.340
Allow me to say one thing.

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:51.450
We'll be playing right into Cesare's 
hands if we continue to do nothing.

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:53.520
Nobunaga will be captured,

00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:57.130
and we will be struck down along with Azuchi.

00:05:57.130 --> 00:05:59.450
Then I'll go with you!

00:06:00.090 --> 00:06:01.790
Right, Mitsu?

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:04.150
All right.

00:06:04.150 --> 00:06:07.800
Hold the line until we 
rescue Nobu and Ranmaru.

00:06:08.140 --> 00:06:09.190
Okay!

00:06:09.190 --> 00:06:11.490
Another ley line is gaining in intensity.

00:06:12.460 --> 00:06:14.540
Azuchi is being drawn to it.

00:06:19.720 --> 00:06:21.020
Don't worry,

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:23.580
we will get out of here.

00:06:31.060 --> 00:06:32.570
Let's rest awhile.

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:36.610
Are you afraid of me?

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:40.910
I am sorry for what happened.

00:06:41.490 --> 00:06:43.690
We may have disrupted the ley lines

00:06:43.690 --> 00:06:45.910
by approaching the Star of the West.

00:06:46.860 --> 00:06:49.350
We couldn't have
 foreseen something like this.

00:06:50.980 --> 00:06:52.010
No,

00:06:53.130 --> 00:06:54.310
it's my fault.

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:57.450
If only I had overcome my 
fear and told everyone.

00:06:57.870 --> 00:07:00.580
If I'd told them about my vision...

00:07:01.470 --> 00:07:06.180
But, I was afraid that they would fear me.

00:07:07.310 --> 00:07:08.590
I couldn't tell them.

00:07:12.380 --> 00:07:15.860
But the visions aren't always bad.

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:22.120
They brought us together, didn't they?

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:25.010
Nobunaga...

00:07:39.830 --> 00:07:41.730
Nobunaga, wait.

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:42.770
I'm not...

00:07:56.130 --> 00:07:57.530
We'll outwit them.

00:07:57.530 --> 00:07:58.310
What?

00:07:59.650 --> 00:08:01.160
We'll go back to your village.

00:08:05.240 --> 00:08:08.190
I won't be so easily duped by you.

00:08:08.190 --> 00:08:10.540
You doubt my intentions?

00:08:10.960 --> 00:08:12.050
Why?

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:15.080
You stink, that's why.

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:17.640
You made Ichihime-sama your bride,

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:20.060
but you knew how she
 felt about Mitsuhide, right?

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:21.640
You're an ass!

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:23.120
So what?

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:26.660
Man, you're not bad-looking, 
you're decent in a fight,

00:08:26.660 --> 00:08:29.080
and now you've got a
 beautiful lady as a wife.

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:31.010
You're a man people'd love to hate!

00:08:31.290 --> 00:08:34.010
I'm honored by your praise.

00:08:35.150 --> 00:08:36.310
Not even sarcasm works!

00:08:36.310 --> 00:08:38.010
Man, I hate you!

00:08:38.430 --> 00:08:41.250
Let's focus on their rescue right now.

00:08:41.740 --> 00:08:46.020
For that to happen,
 you must trust me, Sir Hideyoshi.

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:48.230
Oh, right.

00:08:48.230 --> 00:08:49.870
I wouldn't want to get backstabbed

00:08:49.870 --> 00:08:51.430
in the heat of the moment, after all.

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:53.430
Surely you jest.

00:08:53.700 --> 00:08:55.270
Let us proceed, then.

00:08:55.270 --> 00:08:57.740
I won't let you get the drop on me!

00:09:05.530 --> 00:09:08.920
I have seen you in the 
inferno many times now,

00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:10.850
with the smell of orchids in the air.

00:09:10.850 --> 00:09:11.580
What?

00:09:12.420 --> 00:09:15.150
It felt as though that would 
actually become reality,

00:09:15.610 --> 00:09:17.690
so I couldn't think of 
anything but to save you.

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:20.850
But then before I knew it, the village...

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:23.730
But, you saved me.

00:09:26.360 --> 00:09:28.130
This may be its price.

00:09:30.490 --> 00:09:32.500
The nightmare has come back to life.

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:35.370
Nightmare?

00:09:36.540 --> 00:09:37.870
Ever since I was a kid,

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:42.850
in my dreams, I would take the 
lives of many with my own hands.

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:45.900
It was a constant nightmare,

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:51.060
and with each recurrence,
 it would become more vicious and cruel.

00:09:52.120 --> 00:09:54.300
The raging flames, the smoke,

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:56.330
the countless dead...

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:02.320
What truly terrified me 
was not the nightmare itself,

00:10:03.010 --> 00:10:05.330
but the fact that in the dream,

00:10:05.880 --> 00:10:08.370
I relished war and exulted in slaughter.

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:13.290
A monstrous being who is fond of war

00:10:13.290 --> 00:10:15.750
and thirsts for blood exists within me.

00:10:16.250 --> 00:10:19.280
I fear that someday,

00:10:19.730 --> 00:10:22.920
that monster will emerge and overwhelm me.

00:10:25.190 --> 00:10:26.290
Nobunaga...

00:10:27.220 --> 00:10:31.000
I had resolved to do
 whatever it took to achieve

00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:33.580
my long-awaited dream for unification.

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:35.060
But...

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:39.860
That does not excuse senseless bloodshed!

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:47.090
Born onto a star in a state of war

00:10:47.090 --> 00:10:48.880
during a time of chaos,

00:10:48.880 --> 00:10:51.800
loss of human life is inevitable.

00:10:52.230 --> 00:10:53.620
But even so,

00:10:54.560 --> 00:10:56.830
the specter of death haunts me.

00:10:57.870 --> 00:11:01.920
That is why Father, Nobukatsu, 
and even Shingen-dono died—

00:11:01.920 --> 00:11:02.890
That's not true!

00:11:04.770 --> 00:11:07.230
You <i>are</i> the Savior-King!

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:09.740
You should just follow your own path!

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:15.670
Wh-What's so funny?!

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:20.410
Whether I am the Destroyer-King or 
the Savior-King means nothing to me!

00:11:21.460 --> 00:11:23.790
Aren't you more the Savior-King than I am?

00:11:23.790 --> 00:11:24.740
What?

00:11:24.740 --> 00:11:27.100
You've always saved the lives of others,

00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:29.150
even if it meant endangering your own.

00:11:31.840 --> 00:11:36.240
Ever since I met you,
 I'd forgotten all about my nightmares.

00:11:37.330 --> 00:11:39.330
Don't let yourself be bound by the idea

00:11:39.330 --> 00:11:41.330
of the Savior-King and the Destroyer-King.

00:11:42.410 --> 00:11:43.830
Just as you said earlier,

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:46.360
I will just follow my own path

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:49.370
and do what I should do.

00:11:49.860 --> 00:11:50.840
That is all.

00:11:53.380 --> 00:11:54.840
You're right.

00:11:55.420 --> 00:11:59.860
And right now, I should learn
 of King Arthur's true intentions.

00:12:00.460 --> 00:12:03.980
Depending on what they are,
 we may engage each other in battle.

00:12:04.440 --> 00:12:06.950
I don't care if that causes 
the people of the West

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:08.820
to call me the Destroyer-King.

00:12:09.280 --> 00:12:11.650
I will protect my comrades.

00:12:12.060 --> 00:12:13.520
That is my way.

00:12:14.620 --> 00:12:17.110
Don't forget those words.

00:12:17.510 --> 00:12:18.690
I won't.

00:12:18.690 --> 00:12:20.750
No matter what you may think of me,

00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:22.760
I will never betray you.

00:12:25.960 --> 00:12:26.880
What was that?!

00:12:44.650 --> 00:12:47.670
This was beneath the village?

00:13:00.230 --> 00:13:01.170
What's that?

00:13:08.210 --> 00:13:10.350
I feel like I've seen that somewhere before.

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:15.060
Onikage!

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:18.930
You come back after I let you go?

00:13:19.420 --> 00:13:22.230
You're a strange one, aren't you?

00:13:37.010 --> 00:13:38.930
Azuchi is at rest.

00:13:38.930 --> 00:13:42.720
She seems to have been drawn
 here by the flow of the earlier ley line.

00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:44.250
Confirm our current location.

00:13:44.250 --> 00:13:45.110
Yes, Your Highness.

00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:47.070
Display map.

00:13:49.150 --> 00:13:50.930
Oh? This place...

00:13:51.570 --> 00:13:54.730
Donremy Village, Ranmaru-sama's birthplace.

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:56.300
I see.

00:13:57.330 --> 00:13:59.190
Have you noticed?

00:14:00.260 --> 00:14:03.460
Indeed, it appears that the 
pillars connecting the stars

00:14:03.460 --> 00:14:06.300
mentioned in the ancient
 tomes of Yamatai truly exist.

00:14:06.760 --> 00:14:09.250
The Ladder to the Heavens.

00:14:09.800 --> 00:14:12.310
On the Star of the West,
 we call it the Pillars of Hercules.

00:14:12.890 --> 00:14:15.150
I had no idea that it lay
 beneath Donremy Village.

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:20.260
Indeed, the ley lines show 
no sign of disruption here.

00:14:20.560 --> 00:14:24.860
Here, we can even activate the
 pillars that leads to Yomotsuhirasaka!

00:14:27.070 --> 00:14:28.030
Nobu...

00:14:28.030 --> 00:14:30.270
Displaying enhanced image of Donremy Village.

00:14:32.190 --> 00:14:33.400
How terrible...

00:14:33.400 --> 00:14:34.670
A layer of ashes,

00:14:34.670 --> 00:14:36.460
and an ancient temple in its midst.

00:14:37.380 --> 00:14:38.270
That's...

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:39.810
My betrothed!

00:14:40.300 --> 00:14:44.260
So this place is not known 
to the people of the West?

00:14:44.260 --> 00:14:48.420
No, it was thought to have 
rotted away in distant past.

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:51.300
If we can activate the Ladder 
to the Heavens while we can,

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:53.710
we can return to the Star of the East.

00:14:53.710 --> 00:14:57.680
So because Sir Nobunaga and 
Jeanne visited Donremy Village,

00:14:57.680 --> 00:14:59.880
the Pillars of Hercules will be activated.

00:15:00.680 --> 00:15:02.300
Perhaps it was destiny.

00:15:04.260 --> 00:15:06.610
Jeanne Kaguya d'Arc.

00:15:06.610 --> 00:15:08.310
Her middle name belongs to one

00:15:08.310 --> 00:15:10.370
who came from a people
 capable of crossing the stars.

00:15:10.970 --> 00:15:12.800
Donremy Village was the

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:16.870
fated to be the place where the
 girl who sees visions would be born.

00:15:18.780 --> 00:15:21.980
I have ties to Yomotsuhirasaka, too.

00:15:23.960 --> 00:15:25.120
Are there enemies nearby?

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:30.560
A search party consisting mainly 
of Giant War Armor units

00:15:30.560 --> 00:15:33.080
has been deployed in the southwest forest.

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:34.660
All right.

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:36.570
We will move quickly to outwit them!

00:15:37.130 --> 00:15:39.810
I will go to Nobunaga and 
Ranmaru on the wing-horse,

00:15:39.810 --> 00:15:43.570
while Quo Vadis and Goku engage the 
War Armor search party in the forest!

00:15:44.180 --> 00:15:45.340
Understood.

00:15:45.820 --> 00:15:50.580
I <i>will</i> bring Nobu and Ranmaru back in time!

00:15:51.190 --> 00:15:53.330
I'm counting on you, Mitsuhide-dono.

00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:01.060
Lady Himiko, activating the 
inter-stellar travel device

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:03.100
puts a great burden upon your person—

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:04.050
Don't speak of it.

00:16:04.050 --> 00:16:08.100
None can fathom how much 
I wish to save my betrothed.

00:16:09.160 --> 00:16:10.390
Please, da Vinci-dono,

00:16:11.470 --> 00:16:13.070
give me your aid.

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:17.340
Understood.

00:16:18.550 --> 00:16:22.050
She has such an indomitable spirit.

00:16:32.370 --> 00:16:33.490
Nobunaga.

00:16:33.490 --> 00:16:34.390
Look!

00:16:35.090 --> 00:16:36.260
Azuchi.

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:39.620
That's...

00:16:40.230 --> 00:16:41.190
Mitsu!

00:16:43.070 --> 00:16:45.120
You have me to deal with!

00:16:46.240 --> 00:16:48.390
It's been too long, Cesare!

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:54.580
I had no desire to see you again,
 General Caesar!

00:16:56.180 --> 00:16:57.110
H-Hey,

00:16:57.110 --> 00:16:58.580
you're doing this right away?

00:17:03.430 --> 00:17:05.330
I knew you'd do it, Mitsu!

00:17:05.330 --> 00:17:06.410
There's no time.

00:17:06.410 --> 00:17:08.040
We will use Himiko-sama's Regalia

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:09.800
to activate the ancient

00:17:09.800 --> 00:17:12.800
Ladder to the Heavens,
 which connects our stars, and go home.

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:13.480
What?

00:17:13.480 --> 00:17:15.000
I'll explain more later.

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:17.910
Hideyoshi and Caesar
 are fending off the pursuit.

00:17:17.910 --> 00:17:19.430
We'll return to Azuchi.

00:17:19.710 --> 00:17:20.720
All right.

00:17:26.260 --> 00:17:27.810
What are you waiting for?!

00:17:28.180 --> 00:17:29.580
Use that light thing!

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:31.230
Because of the ley line turbulence,

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:32.840
I cannot amass enough energy.

00:17:32.840 --> 00:17:35.000
Huh? What the hell?

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:36.810
It seems we are in the same boat.

00:17:40.970 --> 00:17:42.230
No matter.

00:17:42.230 --> 00:17:45.260
Just the fact that you
 raised your blade against me

00:17:45.260 --> 00:17:48.100
is enough cause to kill you.

00:17:48.440 --> 00:17:49.600
Die!

00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:57.280
It's comforting to see you 
haven't changed at all, Cesare.

00:17:57.280 --> 00:17:59.190
I thought that when I saw you abandon

00:17:59.190 --> 00:18:02.310
the Donremy villagers
 and retreat with your men.

00:18:02.610 --> 00:18:03.840
Oh?

00:18:03.840 --> 00:18:07.070
To think such considerate words 
would come out of your mouth.

00:18:07.070 --> 00:18:10.320
Has a life of comfort on the 
Star of the East made you weak?

00:18:10.550 --> 00:18:12.340
Say what you will!

00:18:16.620 --> 00:18:17.980
A concealed gun?

00:18:17.980 --> 00:18:19.190
Coward.

00:18:19.710 --> 00:18:22.160
The ends justify the means.

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:24.220
You used to feel the same way.

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:26.030
Have you taken up a new religion?

00:18:28.070 --> 00:18:29.540
I don't believe I have.

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:33.510
Then has a woman unmanned you at last?

00:18:40.480 --> 00:18:42.010
It's almost time.

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:44.390
I hope you'll come through, 
Mitsu and Himiko-sama.

00:18:57.170 --> 00:18:58.570
Lady Himiko...

00:18:59.350 --> 00:19:00.590
Don't worry.

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:02.570
I will withstand this.

00:19:04.490 --> 00:19:06.690
Nobunaga and Ranmaru have been rescued!

00:19:07.970 --> 00:19:08.940
Understood.

00:19:08.940 --> 00:19:10.950
Opening hatch in seven minutes.

00:19:10.950 --> 00:19:12.560
All right! We're on our way!

00:19:12.560 --> 00:19:13.300
All right!

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:16.940
Nobunaga and Ranmaru's rescue was a success.

00:19:16.940 --> 00:19:18.090
Return to ship!

00:19:18.400 --> 00:19:19.330
Understood!

00:19:19.330 --> 00:19:23.730
Cesare, you will never understand me!

00:19:42.020 --> 00:19:43.410
To all crew!

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:45.130
Return to ship at once!

00:20:06.380 --> 00:20:07.530
Sorry, Nobu.

00:20:07.530 --> 00:20:08.420
I must go ahead!

00:20:08.420 --> 00:20:09.300
Take Ranmaru.

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:09.740
Mitsu?!

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:12.940
Damn it!

00:20:14.870 --> 00:20:16.480
I won't let you escape!

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:18.980
Now, hand over the Regalia!

00:20:22.870 --> 00:20:24.780
I'll kill you this time for sure!

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:29.790
Just a little longer!

00:20:30.300 --> 00:20:33.530
I told you I won't let you escape,
 prophet girl!

00:20:33.530 --> 00:20:36.530
I will be the one who takes your place!

00:20:36.530 --> 00:20:39.300
I will obtain a Regalia 
and join the Round Table!

00:20:39.950 --> 00:20:41.040
Don't let me down, Mitsu!

00:20:41.330 --> 00:20:43.870
You are standing in my way!

00:20:52.770 --> 00:20:54.450
You will not return alive!

00:20:55.780 --> 00:20:56.950
There is no time.

00:20:58.950 --> 00:21:00.860
Come on!

00:21:05.970 --> 00:21:07.150
Nobu-sama!

00:21:07.150 --> 00:21:07.960
You're safe!

00:21:08.570 --> 00:21:10.200
My thanks, Monkey!

00:21:10.670 --> 00:21:12.470
Mitsuhide-sama, please hurry!

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:13.840
Mitsu!

00:21:14.060 --> 00:21:16.710
Mitsuhide-dono, hurry!

00:21:19.820 --> 00:21:21.980
You will not return alive!

00:21:25.300 --> 00:21:26.010
Mitsu!

00:21:27.830 --> 00:21:28.610
Monkey!

00:21:28.610 --> 00:21:29.650
Get me a wing-horse!

00:21:29.650 --> 00:21:30.830
I will save Mitsu!

00:21:30.830 --> 00:21:32.080
No, Nobu-sama!

00:21:32.080 --> 00:21:33.320
Please restrain yourself!

00:21:33.320 --> 00:21:34.560
Let me go!

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:36.530
Leave it to me!

00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:39.000
I will bring Sir Mitsuhide back!

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:40.530
Caesar, you ass!

00:21:48.520 --> 00:21:50.620
I'm sorry, Caesar-dono...

00:21:51.510 --> 00:21:52.690
Caesar-dono!

00:21:55.860 --> 00:21:56.950
Cesare...

00:21:59.380 --> 00:22:00.750
Damn you!

00:22:04.020 --> 00:22:06.720
Ladder to the Heavens, activate!

00:22:07.060 --> 00:22:09.220
Mitsuhide!

00:22:23.600 --> 00:22:25.600
The Pillars of Hercules...

00:22:26.470 --> 00:22:28.760
They've awakened from their slumber

00:22:29.240 --> 00:22:31.750
to link the fates of the two stars.

00:22:32.370 --> 00:22:35.950
It is the fanfare announcing the 
imminent restoration of the Holy Grail.

00:24:11.230 --> 00:24:15.210
Childhood memories are 
ephemeral, yet so vibrant.

00:24:16.080 --> 00:24:19.140
Lonely, difficult, yet heartwarming...

00:24:20.110 --> 00:24:21.900
Next time: The Hermit.

00:24:22.420 --> 00:24:25.330
Let our bond be everlasting.
